| **Filename**   | `{{ issue.filename }}:{{ issue.line_number }}` |
| **Issue**      | {{ issue.issue_text }} |
| **More Info**  | {{ issue.more_info }} |
```python
{{ issue.code.strip() }}
```
</details>
{% endfor %}
</details>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
